  "title": "Must See Monday – Events of the Week: Masquerade Ball at the Christmas Spiegeltent, Tim Peake &#038; The Shimmer Band",
  "content": "<p><em>14th December 2015</em></p>\n<p><strong>TIP OF THE WEEK<br /></strong><strong>What</strong>: Masquerade Ball // <strong>Where</strong>: Christmas Spiegeltent // <strong>When</strong>: Sat 19th Dec (8.00pm)  // <strong>Cost:</strong> £22<br /><a href=\"http://christmasspiegeltent.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/masquerade_-1800x575-1-978x312.png\" alt=\"masquerade_-1800x575-1\" width=\"800\" height=\"255\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-10636\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/masquerade_-1800x575-1-978x312.png 978w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/masquerade_-1800x575-1-300x96.png 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/masquerade_-1800x575-1.png 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a><span>Swerving a line between black tie do, festival chic and low down &#8216;n&#8217; dirty, the Spiegeltent Masquerade Ball is a firm fixture, and one of the hottest-tickets-in-town, on Bristol&#8217;s festive calendar. Sold out before any other event for the last two years the team promise another wild and spectacular night of excellent live music, weird and wonderful performances, hip shaking grooves and, of course, the opportunity to get dressed up to the absolute nines in whatever floats your boat. </span></p>\n<p><span>Sequins, feathers and dickie bows vs. grimey fishnets and 80s lurex – anything goes. </span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">To find out more click <a href=\"http://christmasspiegeltent.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</strong></p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Christmas at the Spiegeltent Royale Speech\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ftRjotdcb8g?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>OTHER TIPS<br /></strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Live on the Big Screen: Tim Peake goes into Space @ At-Bristol Science Centre// Tue 15th Dec (All Day) // Cost: Free</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.at-bristol.org.uk/event/special-show-tim-peake-goes-space\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/space_station_over_earth-678x450.jpg\" width=\"678\" height=\"450\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10635 size-large\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/space_station_over_earth-678x450.jpg 678w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/space_station_over_earth-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/space_station_over_earth-120x80.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 678px) 100vw, 678px\" /></a></p>\n<p>Watch a live feed of British ESA astronaut Tim Peake blast off to the International Space Station live on Big Screen Bristol.</p>\n<p><span>Tim Peake will be the first British European Space Agency astronaut to live and work on the ISS. Come and watch his mission unfold.</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong></strong></strong><strong style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">To find out more then click <a href=\"https://www.at-bristol.org.uk/event/special-show-tim-peake-goes-space\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"documentFirstHeading\"><strong><span class=\"\" id=\"parent-fieldname-title-f3d1c3907c6d4d16927837cfd4e935e2\">The Shimmer Band </span>@ Louisiana // Fri 18th Dec (7.30pm) // Cost: £6<br /><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/696129467184640/\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/12235133_874605165988748_9186234780501979370_n.jpg\" alt=\"12235133_874605165988748_9186234780501979370_n\" width=\"960\" height=\"369\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-10638\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/12235133_874605165988748_9186234780501979370_n.jpg 960w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/12235133_874605165988748_9186234780501979370_n-300x115.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p>Bristol self styled psychedelic/Krautrockers The Shimmer band return home to perform at one their favourite haunts.</p>\n<p>Expect the standard levels of adrenaline inducing pop and Tom Wolfe homages.<strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.arnolfini.org.uk/whatson/john-akomfrah-vertigo-sea-1\" target=\"_blank\"></a></strong><strong>To find out more click <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/696129467184640/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Kevin McGough</strong></p>\n<p></p>",
